% Bibliography for the NeurReps Extended Abstract.
%
% Every field here is transcribed from docs/03-references.md, which is this project's record of
% what was read and what was only summarised. Fields that record does not carry -- volume, issue,
% article number, page range for several of the journal entries -- are ABSENT rather than guessed.
% Under the verified/inferred rule in docs/AGENTS.md a bibliographic field recalled from memory is
% inferred, and an inferred field in a submitted bibliography is indistinguishable from a correct
% one. Entries needing a lookup carry the marker in a `note` field, which BibTeX prints, so an
% unverified reference is visible in the compiled bibliography rather than only in a comment. It has
% to be a real field: `%` does not start a comment inside a BibTeX entry, and putting the marker
% behind one silently deleted all three of these references from the first compiled draft.
% scripts/check_submission.py counts the markers and refuses to pass while any remain.

